# Landmarks of the six regions reached by stagecoach (all far metas: drawn only off the farm).
# Each is a blocking structure with a grounded base row. Colours are designed for the palette the region
# really shows (main.c pal_push): Pinecrest wears GRASS in WINTER colours, Amberwood in FALL colours,
# Saltmarsh Harbour and Sunbake Mesa swap CROP and STONE for the beach's sand-and-stone versions
# (colour 0 of WOOD, CROP and STONE is then the same cream as SAND, so those pieces sit on open sand).
# Only colour 3 (the outline) is close to the same in every palette; background showing inside a quadrant
# must be that quadrant's own ground (GRASS on grass, WOOD/CROP/STONE on sand, STONE on water).

far

# Saltmarsh Harbour: a moored two-master seen from the quay. Stands on water rows. STONE is the beach's
